        <mxCell id="note-rls" value="RLS target per tenant-scoped PHI table: tenant_id = current_setting('app.tenant_id')::uuid. Trusted backend sets context with SET LOCAL per transaction; deny missing context and use a non-bypass app role. Add tenant-aware composite foreign keys so child and parent rows cannot cross tenants." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
